{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13357","headline":"喜陆侍御破石埭草寇东峰亭赋诗 · 袁傪","name":"喜陆侍御破石埭草寇东峰亭赋诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"古诗东峰上，登临兴有余。\n同观白简使，新报赤囊书。\n几处闲烽堠，千方庆里闾。\n欣欣夏木长，寂寂晚烟徐。\n战罢言归马，远师赋出车。\n因知越范蠡，湖海意[何如]。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"袁傪","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_13357.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_13357","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}